\p{This layer uses the sealed Segal-category interface and categorical functor objects. Its bootstrap implementation is in Root/; agreement with monads in \code{Mat(Kan)} is \ref{at-sp-0003}. \code{MapCat} is the core of a categorical functor object. \code{MapRel} is used only inside explicit presentation-level constructions and comparison proofs.}
